---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面走丢了 · 卡卡罗特AI">
  <section class="container not-found">
    <div class="doodle-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="lost-pencil" viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="72">
        <path d="M14 50 L40 24 L48 32 L22 58 L12 60 Z" fill="#ffd65a" stroke="#2b2b2b" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        <path d="M40 24 L44 20 Q46 18 48 20 Q50 22 48 24 L44 28" fill="#ff6b35" stroke="#2b2b2b" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        <path d="M14 50 L12 60 L22 58" fill="#fff" stroke="#2b2b2b" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round" />
      </svg>
      <svg class="wobble-line" viewBox="0 0 200 24" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <path
          d="M4 16 Q20 4 34 14 T62 16 T88 8 T112 18 T138 10 T164 16 T196 12"
          fill="none"
          stroke="#2b2b2b"
          stroke-width="3"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-dasharray="6 8"
        />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h1 class="code">4<span class="zero">0</span>4</h1>
    <p class="oops">哎呀，这一页走丢了…</p>
    <p class="hint">可能是链接过期了，或者被铅笔不小心擦掉啦。</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a href="/" class="sketch-btn primary">回到首页 🏠</a>
      <a href="/blog/" class="sketch-btn">去文章列表 📚</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 72px;
    min-height: 420px;
  }

  .doodle-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 240px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .lost-pencil {
    position: absolute;
    top: -34px;
    left: 6px;
    transform: rotate(-12deg);
    animation: pencil-wobble 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .wobble-line {
    width: 100%;
    height: 24px;
  }

  @keyframes pencil-wobble {
    0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-12deg) translateX(0); }
    50% { transform: rotate(-6deg) translateX(140px); }
  }

  .code {
    font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 14vw, 7.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .zero {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--accent);
    transform: rotate(-8deg);
  }

  .oops {
    font-family: var(--font-hand);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
  }

  .hint {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
</style>
